# Global Consolidation Log

Append-only history of every near-duplicate-entry merge performed via `/nelly-memory
consolidate`. Never edit or remove prior entries. The originals a consolidation supersedes are
moved to `<project-slug>/archive/`, not deleted — this log records why they were merged and
into what.

## Log

### <YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ>

- Action: consolidated
- Merged Entries: <name1>, <name2>, ...
- Result Entry: <name of the new merged entry>
- Reason: <why these entries were judged near-duplicates and how the merged entry reconciles
  them>
- Trigger: user request via /nelly-memory consolidate

